# v12-merlin: written by tools/cycles scenarios. Cycle table grid: holds at throttle 0.75.
# Each hold is 0.5 s of settling and at least 24 whole cycles; 0.25 s sweeps join the holds.
# The renderer reads cut RPM THROTTLE SECONDS as a hold with the ignition off. snarl does not read these files.
hold 600 0.75 5.3
sweep 600 750 0.75 0.25
hold 750 0.75 4.4
sweep 750 1000 0.75 0.25
hold 1000 0.75 3.4
sweep 1000 1250 0.75 0.25
hold 1250 0.75 2.9
sweep 1250 1500 0.75 0.25
hold 1500 0.75 2.5
sweep 1500 1750 0.75 0.25
hold 1750 0.75 2.2
sweep 1750 2000 0.75 0.25
hold 2000 0.75 2
sweep 2000 2250 0.75 0.25
hold 2250 0.75 1.8
sweep 2250 2500 0.75 0.25
hold 2500 0.75 1.7
sweep 2500 2750 0.75 0.25
hold 2750 0.75 1.6
sweep 2750 3000 0.75 0.25
hold 3000 0.75 1.5
